                <text type="forecast">Partly cloudy. Slight chance of a shower west of Leigh Creek in the evening. Near zero chance of rain elsewhere. The chance of a thunderstorm west of Leigh Creek in the evening. Winds east to southeasterly 20 to 30 km/h tending east to northeasterly 25 to 35 km/h during the morning. Overnight temperatures falling to between 13 and 24 with daytime temperatures reaching 33 to 40.</text>
